    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Story]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where Yatube has become a powerful entertainment industry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist starts a Yatube business in the early days and becomes the CEO of a hugely successful entertainment company that discovers talented streamers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He discovers famous streamers such as [BJ Gwangna, BJ Dog King, BJ Sikshin Yang, BJ Talgeo] and builds the world's leading YouTube entertainment company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, one day, rumors and sexual harassment allegations against 'BJ Shine Na' lead to a major setback for the protagonist, and he is eventually removed as CEO by the board of directors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, it was all a ploy by the board and BJ Shine Na to remove him from power. Left penniless, the protagonist becomes homeless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite this betrayal, the protagonist, who has always protected and supported the streamer, still has people who believe in him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among them, a rookie streamer named 'BJ Hanna' continues to believe in the protagonist and reaches out to him when he becomes homeless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deeply hurt by the betrayal, the protagonist is encouraged by BJ Hannah's warm smile and support, and decides to try his hand at the top again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, the protagonist and BJ Hanna start an entertainment company and start over from scratch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[How to play].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The actions you choose will cause a certain amount of time to pass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The day is divided into morning, afternoon, and evening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can grow by managing BJ Hannah's health, beauty, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are short of money, you can earn money with part-time jobs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use the money to buy better equipment to attract more viewers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit more viewers and earn the \u201cRed Diamond Button\u201d medal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[game features].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game consists of 8 multiple endings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endings are triggered by circumstances or Hannah's health levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ending contains an H-scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Japanese voice acting is available for the female protagonist. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated with  (free version)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Story]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where Yatube has become a powerful entertainment industry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist starts a Yatube business in the early days and becomes the CEO of a hugely successful entertainment company that discovers talented streamers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He discovers famous streamers such as [BJ Gwangna, BJ Dog King, BJ Sikshin Yang, BJ Talgeo] and builds the world's leading YouTube entertainment company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, one day, rumors and sexual harassment allegations against 'BJ Shine Na' lead to a major setback for the protagonist, and he is eventually removed as CEO by the board of directors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, it was all a ploy by the board and BJ Shine Na to remove him from power. Left penniless, the protagonist becomes homeless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite this betrayal, the protagonist, who has always protected and supported the streamer, still has people who believe in him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among them, a rookie streamer named 'BJ Hanna' continues to believe in the protagonist and reaches out to him when he becomes homeless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deeply hurt by the betrayal, the protagonist is encouraged by BJ Hannah's warm smile and support, and decides to try his hand at the top again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, the protagonist and BJ Hanna start an entertainment company and start over from scratch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[How to play].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The actions you choose will cause a certain amount of time to pass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The day is divided into morning, afternoon, and evening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can grow by managing BJ Hannah's health, beauty, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are short of money, you can earn money with part-time jobs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use the money to buy better equipment to attract more viewers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit more viewers and earn the \u201cRed Diamond Button\u201d medal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[game features].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game consists of 8 multiple endings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endings are triggered by circumstances or Hannah's health levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ending contains an H-scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Japanese voice acting is available for the female protagonist. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated with  (free version)</p>",
